  "description": "Connects the OASIS to PocketBase via its REST API. PocketBase is a self-hosted, single-file open-source backend with realtime subscriptions, authentication, and file storage. No PocketBase SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
